| WP8-D10 | â€” (CLI) | `swaml binding check` findings (WP8-M03) | One line per finding with the JSON Pointer of the offending value, the identity and the reason; missing costs are marked as findings, not errors. The root is the empty pointer, printed `""` in the text as in `--json`. |
| WP8-D11 | SW2009 | A `kind`, `priority`, `preemptive`, `periodNs` or `responseNs` attribute of a Task occurrence whose effective value is not a constant of its type (a `TaskKind` literal, a bool, or a `uint` up to 2^53 âˆ’ 1) in the constant sublanguage (WP4-S05) | `{attribute} of task {task} must be a constant {TaskKind literal \| bool \| uint} value.`, with ` up to 9007199254740991` before the period for a `uint` constant above 2^53 âˆ’ 1 (reported at the deployment's platform reference; the Task takes part in no other task rule) |
